  "data": {
    "body": "Two of these series converge, and two diverge. Which two converge?\n(I) $\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{k^{4}+1}}$\n(II) $\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty} k^{-e}$\n(III) $\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{k(\\ln k)^{2}}$\n(IV) $\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}(1+1 / k)^{k}$",
    "solution": [
